{"synopsis":"Lu Ye, Nine-Lives Heavenly Sovereign yang dikagumi semua orang, pada hari dia naik ke alam Immortal, justru dikhianati oleh delapan Empress yang dibesarkannya sendiri. Nine Heavens Sword Princess: “Karena kau, seluruh dunia memanggilku sebagai pelayanmu!” Fairy Hong Ling: “Kalau bukan karena kau, aku sudah menjadi pasangan abadi dengannya. Kau pantas mati!” Vermilion Demon Empress: “Kau bilang mereka yang menyakitiku? Justru yang menyakitiku adalah dirimu sendiri!” Dengan Space-Time Reversal, Lu Ye terlahir kembali. Di kehidupan baru ini, dia bersumpah tidak akan mengulangi kesalahan yang sama, dan membiarkan delapan wanita itu menghadapi nasib mereka sendiri!","alternative_title":"八女帝全背叛，重生悔到肠断","author":"番茄小说, 李3疯","artist":"熊漫社","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"6ca1313f-f748-441d-91f0-b7214611dcce","number":"33","chapter":"33","title":"Chapter 33","date":"2026-07-29","released":"2026-07-29","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"7e19d386-1397-40f7-917e-89857fc001ec","number":"32","chapter":"32","title":"Chapter 32","date":"2026-07-22","released":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"325f6cdc-9858-48a5-ae31-d0e42e0e819e","number":"31","chapter":"31","title":"Chapter 31","date":"2026-07-15","released":"2026-07-15","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"b7479dc6-c0f4-481a-a891-354471deb32a","number":"30","chapter":"30","title":"Chapter 30","date":"2026-07-08","released":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"def31fa1-66de-4e49-b93f-ef035eb2282b","number":"29","chapter":"29","title":"Chapter 29","date":"2026-07-01","released":"2026-07-01","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"56414b99-1d6b-4485-895d-d4645a8b5f3d","number":"28","chapter":"28","title":"Chapter 28","date":"2026-06-24","released":"2026-06-24","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"b4ccb641-4bd9-475c-bdfc-d9d0daf66687","number":"27","chapter":"27","title":"Chapter 27","date":"2026-06-17","released":"2026-06-17","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"2ffea846-05cc-4173-a411-289545b5f155","number":"26","chapter":"26","title":"Chapter 26","date":"20